Title:  Groups define roles for their members

Tags:   groups, roles

Long Title: The culture for each group includes definitions and expectations for various roles assigned to group members.

AKA:    roles

Topics Index: culture; roles; groups; 

Seq:    8.2

Display Seq: 47

Level:  3 - Topic

